  'w1a.r_tpl_0_name': 'Full fitness review',
  'w1a.r_tpl_0_prompt': 'Give me my FULL FITNESS REVIEW. FIRST read my REAL data from the last ~3 weeks with your tools (workouts done vs planned, volume & intensity by sport, cardiac drift, CTL/ATL/TSB load & monotony, recovery & sleep, HRV if available, RPE, nutrition/intake, injuries or pain, goals and upcoming races). Then produce a STRUCTURED and ACTIONABLE report, backed by numbers:\n1. **Fitness state** — a clear one-sentence verdict (fresh / fit / fatigued / overloaded / undertrained).\n2. **What\'s improving** — concrete positive signals (with the numbers).\n3. **Points of attention** — fatigue, stagnation, imbalance, injury risk, insufficient sleep or nutrition.\n4. **My recommendations** — 3 to 5 PRECISE, prioritized actions: raise/lower volume (by how much), make intervals faster or slower, increase strength loads, place a deload week, adjust sleep/nutrition… EACH recommendation justified by real data.\nBase EVERYTHING on my real numbers (never made up). If a data point is missing, say so in one line. Direct and no fluff.',
